    <briefdescription>
<para>Demonstrates the <ref refid="struct_x_uart_ps" kindref="compound">XUartPs</ref> driver in polled mode using local loopback. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The example runs on the ZynqMP evaluation board (ZCU102). It sends data and expects to receive the same data through the device using the local loopback mode in polled mode by using the <ref refid="struct_x_uart_ps" kindref="compound">XUartPs</ref> driver.</para><para><simplesect kind="note"><para>If the device does not work properly, the example may hang.</para></simplesect>
